# Example users file for the toy OIDC provider.
# Copy to users.txt next to app.py (git checkout), or to
# /etc/qiip/oidc-users.txt (RPM install; see docs/user-guide.md), chmod 0600,
# and edit before use.
# Format: username:password   (bare names get the OIDC_DOMAIN suffix at login;
# full emails like alice@somelab.example.com are used as-is)
# EXAMPLE ONLY — replace these with your own test users.
user1:user1
user2:user2
